<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/olympic-logic" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5354260); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5354260&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610071789" alt="Olympic Logic" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5354260)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/olympic-logic" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5354260); return false;">Olympic Logic</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1586372342 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">08 Apr 2020 18:59</span></p>
</div>
